        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "摩根",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
          "text": "但是阿米娅不在这里......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "推进之王",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
          "text": "这是好事。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "摩根",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
          "text": "呃，也对。就算是阿米娅，也未必能挡得住这老怪物。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "摩根",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
          "text": "不知道她和博士是不是快成功了......唉，我想什么呢，就算他们能关闭城防炮，眼下我们也快被撕成碎片了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "摩根",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
          "text": "维娜，我们该怎么办？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "推进之王",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
          "text": "跑。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "推进之王",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
          "text": "我们不想......更不能死在这里。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "不能再这样僵持下去了。"
